#: vpn-server.php
msgid "Runs a VPN server on this site, enabling individuals and small businesses to quickly set up a lightweight virtual private network. This is an implementation of PHPVPN (Packet Handoff Protocol VPN) for WordPress. To connect, please install the PHPVPN client for Windows, macOS, or Linux."
